# Jos Metropolis Elevation Analysis

## Project Overview
This project focuses on the analysis and visualization of elevation across Jos Metropolis using GIS.

## Objective
To visualize elevation patterns across Jos Metropolis and produce a clear and informative map.

## Tools Used
- QGIS
- Digital Elevation Model (DEM)

